🫦 Togetherly • v1.29.3

— Widgets no longer go blank when you switch between connections: names and moods stay put.
— Widgets are not wiped when the app wakes up with a session that has not warmed up yet.
— Photos are resized before they reach the widget, so the extension has enough memory to show them.
— Drawing together is smooth now: your partner's stroke appears at once and no longer disappears when they lift the finger.
